  ('0f09f692-4b06-423b-9df2-290811490109', 'Class teacher reports a calm week in class.', 'Engagement 3/5, attention 2/5, cooperation 3/5, regulation 3/5 (regulated). 1-step instructions: 2/7 (28.6%), partial physical prompt. No behaviour incidents. Breaks: 0.', 'Consistent effort. having a parent in the room continues to work; generalisation still limited.', 'Repeat today’s plan for 1-step instructions; add one new example to check generalisation.', '{"24381233-84aa-4abd-ac41-79432c8f4a7d"}', 'Steady progress today. Ira needed a few reminders but finished the activities. Try "Helper at home" at a calm time of day.', '2026-09-03T04:38:00.000Z', '2026-09-03T04:38:00.000Z', 'c92376df-53dc-440e-8268-fcf0c8dc2011'),
  ('57080e1c-cf62-419f-9d3d-fda6d1a3a2f9', 'Mother reports she practised ''Picture card at snack time'' at home most days this week.', 'Engagement 3/5, attention 2/5, cooperation 2/5, regulation 3/5 (regulated). PECS exchanges: 4/10 (40%), model/gesture. No behaviour incidents. Breaks: 1.', 'Consistent effort. letting her choose the reward continues to work; generalisation still limited.', 'Probe PECS exchanges at the start (cold probe), then teaching trials with letting her choose the reward.', '{"9263c4d9-bd58-4c32-86e2-d3eab24ab081"}', 'Myra worked steadily today on hands over a picture card to ask for something. She needed some help but kept trying. Please keep going with "Picture card at snack time" this week.', '2026-09-03T06:10:00.000Z', '2026-09-03T06:10:00.000Z', '8e94c13e-ee62-4ad4-8a50-2e27fce9bd4d'),
  ('20f195fa-79b6-4663-9c6c-9ab4254eb3e9', 'Mother reports she practised ''Colour sorting with bangles'' at home most days this week.', 'Engagement 3/5, attention 3/5, cooperation 2/5, regulation 3/5 (regulated). colour matching: 3/7 (42.9%), partial physical prompt; counting to 10: 2/8 (25%), full physical prompt. No behaviour incidents. Breaks: 2.', 'Consistent effort. movement breaks continues to work; generalisation still limited.', 'Target counting to 10. Fade to the next prompt level; keep movement breaks. Avoid long tasks.', '{"1dc04a61-be4a-4f27-adfe-a36f8730e60d"}', 'Steady progress today. Kavya needed a few reminders but finished the activities. Try "Colour sorting with bangles" at a calm time of day.', '2026-09-03T06:37:00.000Z', '2026-09-03T06:37:00.000Z', '68e54617-51f3-4b9b-ab2c-db49b3665be5'),
  ('7b803204-9ce9-499f-84f2-149281fbdfa9', 'Grandmother reports sleep ok, had breakfast, mood okay at home.', 'Engagement 2/5, attention 3/5, cooperation 2/5, regulation 3/5 (regulated). head control: 3/6 (50%), model/gesture. No behaviour incidents. Breaks: 1.', 'Consistent effort. letting him choose the reward continues to work; generalisation still limited.', 'Probe head control at the start (cold probe), then teaching trials with letting him choose the reward.', '{"8eed3681-19e6-426d-91f4-eaf93f5ffc95"}', 'Sid settled in well and worked on holds head up steadily while sitting with support. Some parts were easy, some still need help — that is normal at this stage.', '2026-09-03T06:37:00.000Z', '2026-09-03T06:37:00.000Z', '42fb9326-d966-4c8e-94ca-4e55da47fbe9'),
  ('5ef2e7c6-f9c4-4517-8ce5-02982b645f21', 'Mother reports he practised ''Snip the paper strips'' at home most days this week.', 'Engagement 3/5, attention 2/5, cooperation 2/5, regulation 2/5 (under-aroused). snipping with scissors: 1/7 (14.3%), partial physical prompt. No behaviour incidents. Breaks: 1.', 'Steady session, in line with recent weeks. snipping with scissors still needs prompting.', 'Probe snipping with scissors at the start (cold probe), then teaching trials with letting him choose the reward.', '{"a393952c-e2ff-477c-9f33-52118a519131"}', 'Adi had an ordinary, useful session. We repeated cuts paper with child-safe scissors a few times; he is getting more familiar with it.', '2026-09-03T06:41:00.000Z', '2026-09-03T06:41:00.000Z', 'ac576a2f-9ce4-435c-b020-66c2abd6acb9'),
  ('7e80af5d-cbd6-4d09-9bf8-b1452813f415', 'Father reports sleep good, had breakfast, mood happy at home.', 'Engagement 2/5, attention 2/5, cooperation 2/5, regulation 1/5 (over-aroused). sensory self-regulation: 2/6 (33.3%), partial physical prompt. No behaviour incidents. Breaks: 2.', 'Consistent effort. the quiet room continues to work; generalisation still limited.', 'Probe sensory self-regulation at the start (cold probe), then teaching trials with the quiet room.', '{"e99271d2-45d1-40ce-af95-cb0997c134b1"}', 'Advik settled in well and worked on uses calming tools like a squeeze ball when feeling overwhelmed. Some parts were easy, some still need help — that is normal at this stage.', '2026-09-03T06:43:00.000Z', '2026-09-03T06:43:00.000Z', '580a7543-d6f2-475c-a235-255657dba3f5'),
  ('c3eeaac9-1457-4eb9-97f5-c4219c0e41e5', 'Mother reports sleep good, had breakfast, mood happy at home.', 'Engagement 4/5, attention 3/5, cooperation 3/5, regulation 3/5 (regulated). /k/ and /g/ sounds: 5/8 (62.5%), verbal prompt; 3–4 word sentences: 3/10 (30%), partial physical prompt. No behaviour incidents. Breaks: 0.', 'Steady session, in line with recent weeks. /k/ and /g/ sounds still needs prompting.', 'Target /k/ and /g/ sounds and 3–4 word sentences. Fade to the next prompt level; keep letting her choose the reward. Avoid long tasks.', '{"26254a7a-0799-4820-aeef-67a30ee2d0d1","bca66f87-037d-48d0-b4f7-6bb22762d399"}', 'Anaya settled in well and worked on says ''k'' and ''g'' sounds clearly (like ''cat'' and ''go''). Some parts were easy, some still need help — that is normal at this stage.', '2026-09-03T07:13:00.000Z', '2026-09-03T07:13:00.000Z', '8e94c13e-ee62-4ad4-8a50-2e27fce9bd4d'),
  ('0c4475a7-257d-420d-905a-097b79968aed', 'Mother reports sleep good, had breakfast, mood upset at home.', 'Engagement 3/5, attention 2/5, cooperation 3/5, regulation 3/5 (over-aroused). sitting for 10 minutes: 3/10 (30%), partial physical prompt. No behaviour incidents. Breaks: 1.', 'Settled after a slow start. Performance similar to the last few sessions.', 'Continue sitting for 10 minutes: aim for 10 trials using movement breaks. Start with a 5-minute movement warm-up.', '{"14d2938f-bc72-4e9d-ba18-1787104148ed"}', 'Rahul worked steadily today on sits at the table for a 10-minute activity. He needed some help but kept trying. Please keep going with "Table time" this week.', '2026-09-03T07:15:00.000Z', '2026-09-03T07:15:00.000Z', '8a7186b0-66cb-4898-8ca7-b5d5a4b67f3d'),
  ('495b83d9-6c95-4ad5-b99c-c7f1ca1aee65', '', 'Engagement 3/5, attention 3/5, cooperation 4/5, regulation 3/5 (under-aroused). greetings: 4/8 (50%), model/gesture. No behaviour incidents. Breaks: 0.', 'Consistent effort. modelling continues to work; generalisation still limited.', 'Continue greetings: aim for 10 trials using modelling. Start with a 5-minute movement warm-up.', '{"262c2456-e16d-4250-8840-7faf4b3deeb5"}', 'Steady progress today. Lavanya needed a few reminders but finished the activities. Try "Hello and bye practice" at a calm time of day.', '2026-09-03T07:37:00.000Z', '2026-09-03T07:37:00.000Z', 'c92376df-53dc-440e-8268-fcf0c8dc2011'),
  ('afaf0b2d-5ac3-4e79-861e-7efd35f0b08d', 'Mother reports she has been sleeping better since last week.', 'Engagement 4/5, attention 4/5, cooperation 3/5, regulation 3/5 (regulated). /s/ in initial position: 4/10 (40%), model/gesture. No behaviour incidents. Breaks: 0.', 'Settled after a slow start. Performance similar to the last few sessions.', 'Target /s/ in initial position. Fade to the next prompt level; keep the quiet room. Avoid the noisy room.', '{"8ac85c4a-dde8-479f-8136-f990c210f519"}', 'Sneha settled in well and worked on says the ''s'' sound clearly at the start of words. Some parts were easy, some still need help — that is normal at this stage.', '2026-09-03T07:38:00.000Z', '2026-09-03T07:38:00.000Z', 'c92376df-53dc-440e-8268-fcf0c8dc2011'),
  ('9df80239-f2b8-4e4d-8b87-1231172747b5', 'Mother reports sleep poor, skipped breakfast, mood happy at home.', 'Engagement 3/5, attention 3/5, cooperation 3/5, regulation 4/5 (regulated). reading fluency: 3/8 (37.5%), model/gesture; coins and notes: 2/10 (20%), partial physical prompt. No behaviour incidents. Breaks: 0.', 'Settled after a slow start. Performance similar to the last few sessions.', 'Repeat today’s plan for reading fluency and coins and notes; add one new example to check generalisation.', '{"a2fd1950-d4fe-496b-954a-379608380271","d79096cf-744e-4717-a702-8f61b069455d"}', 'Diya worked steadily today on reads a short passage smoothly. She needed some help but kept trying. Please keep going with "Paired reading" this week.', '2026-09-03T07:48:00.000Z', '2026-09-03T07:48:00.000Z', '934479b0-7350-4029-9b97-4588c53d36d1'),
  ('62b6bcbf-4d57-4ac5-91f7-316f1e99816d', '', 'Engagement 4/5, attention 3/5, cooperation 4/5, regulation 4/5 (regulated). buttoning: 4/6 (66.7%), model/gesture; putting on a T-shirt: 4/9 (44.4%), model/gesture. No behaviour incidents. Breaks: 1.', 'Steady session, in line with recent weeks. buttoning still needs prompting.', 'Target buttoning. Fade to the next prompt level; keep short tasks. Avoid long tasks.', '{"3042465a-5c10-443f-a985-8d48f362e0b9"}', 'Steady progress today. Fatima needed a few reminders but finished the activities. Try "Button practice with Papa’s shirt" at a calm time of day.', '2026-09-03T07:53:00.000Z', '2026-09-03T07:53:00.000Z', 'ac576a2f-9ce4-435c-b020-66c2abd6acb9'),
  ('2550f99f-bd28-4ec1-9e49-6d4f2fd2e5c5', 'Class teacher reports a calm week in class.', 'Engagement 4/5, attention 3/5, cooperation 3/5, regulation 4/5 (regulated). coins and notes: 4/7 (57.1%), partial physical prompt. No behaviour incidents. Breaks: 1.', 'Settled after a slow start. Performance similar to the last few sessions.', 'Target coins and notes. Fade to the next prompt level; keep movement breaks. Avoid spoken-only instructions.', '{"581c4504-9db3-4606-a58a-8edb26e9ab55"}', 'Nikhil worked steadily today on recognises coins and notes up to ₹100. He needed some help but kept trying. Please keep going with "Shopkeeper game" this week.', '2026-09-03T08:02:00.000Z', '2026-09-03T08:02:00.000Z', '8a7186b0-66cb-4898-8ca7-b5d5a4b67f3d'),
