  ('1b33f270-d3c8-468f-a260-2c4634f3a451', 'Mother reports sleep poor, had breakfast, mood okay at home.', 'Engagement 3/5, attention 2/5, cooperation 3/5, regulation 2/5 (under-aroused). 1-step instructions: 3/6 (50%), model/gesture. No behaviour incidents. Breaks: 0.', 'Harder session — Tara was under-aroused and needed more support. spoken-only instructions made it worse.', 'Probe 1-step instructions at the start (cold probe), then teaching trials with a choice of two.', '{"611fed68-f369-4739-b29b-5994eaa69e91"}', 'Today was a harder day for Tara — she seemed tired and low on energy. That is okay; every child has days like this. We used a choice of two to help her settle. If anything has changed at home, please let us know.', '2026-09-17T07:52:00.000Z', '2026-09-17T07:52:00.000Z', '8e94c13e-ee62-4ad4-8a50-2e27fce9bd4d'),
