  ('05b66c9d-667f-4bd5-aec2-e669a0d8c62d', 'Father reports sleep poor, had breakfast, mood okay at home.', 'Engagement 3/5, attention 4/5, cooperation 3/5, regulation 3/5 (regulated). ''what/where'' questions: 4/7 (57.1%), verbal prompt. No behaviour incidents. Breaks: 1.', 'Dysregulated for the first half; recovered after a break. Monitor over the next sessions.', 'Probe ''what/where'' questions at the start (cold probe), then teaching trials with the visual timer.', '{"f64ecbbb-0433-4efe-abde-c79cd9a2d569"}', 'Today was a harder day for Vikram — he seemed a little unsettled. That is okay; every child has days like this. We used the visual timer to help him settle. If anything has changed at home, please let us know.', '2026-09-17T09:37:00.000Z', '2026-09-17T09:37:00.000Z', 'c92376df-53dc-440e-8268-fcf0c8dc2011'),
  ('79dbfd92-ddb9-45d3-bc99-906cd7b43b79', 'Mother reports sleep good, had breakfast, mood okay at home.', 'Engagement 3/5, attention 3/5, cooperation 3/5, regulation 3/5 (regulated). counting to 10: 6/10 (60%), partial physical prompt. 1 incident (elopement). Breaks: 2.', 'Consistent effort. modelling continues to work; generalisation still limited.', 'Repeat today’s plan for counting to 10; add one new example to check generalisation.', '{"ce6eee22-95ad-4a8e-ae37-c2f1db582545"}', 'Karthik settled in well and worked on counts up to 10 objects, touching each one. Some parts were easy, some still need help — that is normal at this stage.', '2026-09-17T10:24:00.000Z', '2026-09-17T10:24:00.000Z', '8a7186b0-66cb-4898-8ca7-b5d5a4b67f3d'),
