  ('66c77e4b-21c8-4b9d-9ab9-7b975fcd4ec5', '', 'Engagement 3/5, attention 3/5, cooperation 2/5, regulation 3/5 (regulated). responding to name: 3/6 (50%), partial physical prompt. No behaviour incidents. Breaks: 0.', 'Lower engagement today; likely tiredness. Shortened tasks and used having a parent in the room.', 'Target responding to name. Fade to the next prompt level; keep having a parent in the room. Avoid spoken-only instructions.', '{"811b1e2e-7214-43ee-83ba-4f85e7545c71"}', 'Nithya found today a bit difficult and needed more breaks. We kept tasks short and ended on a happy note. Let us know if she slept poorly or is unwell.', '2026-09-17T11:56:00.000Z', '2026-09-17T11:56:00.000Z', 'c92376df-53dc-440e-8268-fcf0c8dc2011'),
  ('f9616373-c096-42ed-b2f5-dccb034c84cd', '', 'Engagement 4/5, attention 4/5, cooperation 3/5, regulation 3/5 (regulated). buttoning: 4/8 (50%), model/gesture. No behaviour incidents. Breaks: 1.', 'Consistent effort. short tasks continues to work; generalisation still limited.', 'Continue buttoning: aim for 10 trials using short tasks. Start with a 5-minute movement warm-up.', '{"b0392f95-9550-4a7f-8604-c6e39d9f2aad"}', 'A good, steady session. Rey practised does up big buttons on their own and enjoyed the breaks in between. Little and often at home is perfect.', '2026-09-17T12:07:00.000Z', '2026-09-17T12:07:00.000Z', '580a7543-d6f2-475c-a235-255657dba3f5')
