  ('d890a0bd-c3bc-4ab1-ad37-55a16537c47d', '', 'Engagement 4/5, attention 3/5, cooperation 3/5, regulation 3/5 (regulated). 3-turn conversations: 2/6 (33.3%), partial physical prompt. No behaviour incidents. Breaks: 0.', 'Consistent effort. the visual timer continues to work; generalisation still limited.', 'Repeat today’s plan for 3-turn conversations; add one new example to check generalisation.', '{"2bc35c29-cce4-4691-bbe1-bd854671a955"}', 'Vihaan settled in well and worked on keeps a short back-and-forth chat going for 3 turns. Some parts were easy, some still need help — that is normal at this stage.', '2026-10-02T10:56:00.000Z', '2026-10-02T10:56:00.000Z', '8e94c13e-ee62-4ad4-8a50-2e27fce9bd4d'),
