  ('09bf1b7d-3a0c-479d-a34e-ad2d4b0bb03d', 'Mother reports sleep ok, had breakfast, mood happy at home.', 'Engagement 4/5, attention 3/5, cooperation 3/5, regulation 4/5 (regulated). counting to 10: 3/8 (37.5%), model/gesture. No behaviour incidents. Breaks: 1.', 'Best session in recent weeks; song cues is helping her stay with tasks for longer.', 'Repeat today’s plan for counting to 10; add one new example to check generalisation.', '{"1dc04a61-be4a-4f27-adfe-a36f8730e60d"}', 'Kavya came in smiling and stayed with every activity. Song cues worked well again. Keep "Counting rotis and spoons" short and fun at home.', '2026-10-29T08:13:00.000Z', '2026-10-29T08:13:00.000Z', '68e54617-51f3-4b9b-ab2c-db49b3665be5'),
  ('933f9c8c-d311-4037-a5b6-33b224da6a29', 'Father reports sleep poor, had breakfast, mood okay at home.', 'Engagement 3/5, attention 3/5, cooperation 3/5, regulation 3/5 (under-aroused). ''what/where'' questions: 6/8 (75%), verbal prompt. No behaviour incidents. Breaks: 0.', 'Harder session — Vikram was under-aroused and needed more support. the group activity made it worse.', 'Continue ''what/where'' questions: aim for 10 trials using the visual timer. Start with a 5-minute movement warm-up.', '{"f64ecbbb-0433-4efe-abde-c79cd9a2d569"}', 'Today was a harder day for Vikram — he seemed tired and low on energy. That is okay; every child has days like this. We used the visual timer to help him settle. If anything has changed at home, please let us know.', '2026-10-29T09:54:00.000Z', '2026-10-29T09:54:00.000Z', 'c92376df-53dc-440e-8268-fcf0c8dc2011'),
  ('25b0c01c-42a8-421b-b1ac-c746f8685571', 'Father mentions a family function over the weekend — late nights.', 'Engagement 3/5, attention 2/5, cooperation 3/5, regulation 2/5 (over-aroused). AAC core words (''more'', ''stop'', ''help''): 7/10 (70%), verbal prompt. No behaviour incidents. Breaks: 2.', 'Covered as substitute; followed the Handover Brief. the first–then board worked as noted by Ms. Pooja.', 'Target AAC core words (''more'', ''stop'', ''help''). Fade to the next prompt level; keep the first–then board. Avoid waiting for turns.', '{"da2f02d7-cf91-46b6-ab9a-be9c605725b1"}', 'Ms. Riya took today’s session while Ms. Pooja is away. Advik adjusted well and worked on uses the talking device to say ''more'', ''stop'' or ''help''.', '2026-10-29T09:57:00.000Z', '2026-10-29T09:57:00.000Z', '8e94c13e-ee62-4ad4-8a50-2e27fce9bd4d'),
  ('1591b76e-ea8d-4fc3-8c9f-f3b46f8d1a01', 'Father mentions a family function over the weekend — late nights.', 'Engagement 4/5, attention 4/5, cooperation 4/5, regulation 3/5 (under-aroused). buttoning: 5/8 (62.5%), model/gesture. No behaviour incidents. Breaks: 2.', 'Consistent effort. letting him choose the reward continues to work; generalisation still limited.', 'Continue buttoning: aim for 10 trials using letting him choose the reward. Start with a 5-minute movement warm-up.', '{"b0392f95-9550-4a7f-8604-c6e39d9f2aad"}', 'Rey worked steadily today on does up big buttons on their own. He needed some help but kept trying. Please keep going with "Button practice with Papa’s shirt" this week.', '2026-10-29T10:23:03.982Z', '2026-10-29T10:23:03.982Z', '580a7543-d6f2-475c-a235-255657dba3f5'),
  ('564e109f-ad48-4c09-8438-664bc1c34a95', 'Mother reports sleep poor, skipped breakfast, mood okay at home.', 'Engagement 3/5, attention 2/5, cooperation 3/5, regulation 3/5 (under-aroused). counting to 10: 9/10 (90%), independent. No behaviour incidents. Breaks: 0.', 'Lower engagement today; likely tiredness. Shortened tasks and used modelling.', 'Continue counting to 10: aim for 10 trials using modelling. Start with a 5-minute movement warm-up.', '{"ce6eee22-95ad-4a8e-ae37-c2f1db582545"}', 'Karthik found today a bit difficult and needed more breaks. We kept tasks short and ended on a happy note. Let us know if he slept poorly or is unwell.', '2026-10-29T10:23:03.982Z', '2026-10-29T10:23:03.982Z', '8a7186b0-66cb-4898-8ca7-b5d5a4b67f3d'),
  ('7a4589ba-789e-47f7-873d-418836104181', '', 'Engagement 2/5, attention 2/5, cooperation 4/5, regulation 3/5 (regulated). messy play tolerance: 5/7 (71.4%), model/gesture. No behaviour incidents. Breaks: 0.', 'Harder session — Rahul was regulated and needed more support. waiting for turns made it worse.', 'Probe messy play tolerance at the start (cold probe), then teaching trials with letting him choose the reward.', '{"9e727095-3d40-4e2f-887b-e2cf621431cd"}', 'Rahul found today a bit difficult and needed more breaks. We kept tasks short and ended on a happy note. Let us know if he slept poorly or is unwell.', '2026-10-29T10:23:03.982Z', '2026-10-29T10:23:03.982Z', 'ac576a2f-9ce4-435c-b020-66c2abd6acb9'),
  ('31e531ee-232a-4cc3-b794-9ac8fccc3fb1', 'Mother reports sleep poor, had breakfast, mood okay at home.', 'Engagement 3/5, attention 4/5, cooperation 3/5, regulation 3/5 (regulated). responding to name: 7/9 (77.8%), verbal prompt. No behaviour incidents. Breaks: 2.', 'Settled after a slow start. Performance similar to the last few sessions.', 'Probe responding to name at the start (cold probe), then teaching trials with song cues.', '{"811b1e2e-7214-43ee-83ba-4f85e7545c71"}', 'A good, steady session. Nithya practised looks up or turns when we call their name and enjoyed the breaks in between. Little and often at home is perfect.', '2026-10-29T10:23:03.982Z', '2026-10-29T10:23:03.982Z', 'c92376df-53dc-440e-8268-fcf0c8dc2011')
insert into public.amendments (id, organization_id, session_id, entity, entity_id, field, old_value, new_value, reason, "by", at, created_at, created_by) values
  ('b4ecfd89-d3f1-4e6a-b3c0-e0ea0b6e9155', '0580e311-3b6f-4fd3-b86d-20ef652ac6ad', '16f64ccc-080a-49b7-88df-ef8a5503b269', 'session_notes', '16f64ccc-080a-49b7-88df-ef8a5503b269', 'notes.planNext', 'Probe 2-word requests at the start (cold probe), then teaching trials with the visual schedule.', 'Probe 2-word requests at the start (cold probe), then teaching trials with the visual schedule. Share the bubble-game video with mother for home practice.', 'Added the home-practice video plan after talking to the parent at pickup.', '8e94c13e-ee62-4ad4-8a50-2e27fce9bd4d', '2026-10-21T04:35:00.000Z', '2026-10-21T04:35:00.000Z', '8e94c13e-ee62-4ad4-8a50-2e27fce9bd4d')
