insert into public.messages (id, organization_id, thread_id, sender_id, body, attachments, created_at, updated_at, created_by) values
  ('149f365c-0169-4054-beba-e72d95c1f7e1', '0580e311-3b6f-4fd3-b86d-20ef652ac6ad', 'c630956c-5718-46db-8b26-3e5acb54fb39', '2b060f38-ce0d-4ff2-84e3-28dbc9fba0d1', 'Good evening Ma''am. Aarav''s home task says the bubble game 5 times a week — should we do it before or after dinner? He gets very excited after dinner.', '[]', '2026-10-23T13:12:00.000Z', '2026-10-23T13:12:00.000Z', '2b060f38-ce0d-4ff2-84e3-28dbc9fba0d1'),
  ('0061b142-e6f1-4434-84ae-7917c6e9ef05', '0580e311-3b6f-4fd3-b86d-20ef652ac6ad', 'c630956c-5718-46db-8b26-3e5acb54fb39', '8e94c13e-ee62-4ad4-8a50-2e27fce9bd4d', 'Good evening Priya ji! Before dinner is better — he is hungry and more motivated to ask. Keep it to 5 minutes and stop while he is still enjoying it.', '[]', '2026-10-23T13:40:00.000Z', '2026-10-23T13:40:00.000Z', '8e94c13e-ee62-4ad4-8a50-2e27fce9bd4d'),
  ('d0c00346-aa5a-4394-affa-40e3856e01f1', '0580e311-3b6f-4fd3-b86d-20ef652ac6ad', 'c630956c-5718-46db-8b26-3e5acb54fb39', '2b060f38-ce0d-4ff2-84e3-28dbc9fba0d1', 'Thank you! He said ''more bubble'' twice yesterday!', '[]', '2026-10-24T02:45:00.000Z', '2026-10-24T02:45:00.000Z', '2b060f38-ce0d-4ff2-84e3-28dbc9fba0d1'),
  ('9af7601d-c6f0-465c-97d0-f96c961e16cd', '0580e311-3b6f-4fd3-b86d-20ef652ac6ad', 'c630956c-5718-46db-8b26-3e5acb54fb39', '8e94c13e-ee62-4ad4-8a50-2e27fce9bd4d', 'That''s wonderful! I''ve added it to today''s notes. Please send a short video when you get a chance.', '[]', '2026-10-24T04:32:00.000Z', '2026-10-24T04:32:00.000Z', '8e94c13e-ee62-4ad4-8a50-2e27fce9bd4d'),
  ('13c5673c-f6a4-40ec-b133-c9f11823ffbd', '0580e311-3b6f-4fd3-b86d-20ef652ac6ad', 'c630956c-5718-46db-8b26-3e5acb54fb39', '580a7543-d6f2-475c-a235-255657dba3f5', 'Hi Priya ji, in OT this week we are working on his pincer grasp. If you have rajma or chana at home, the bean-posting game in the app is perfect.', '[]', '2026-10-26T11:00:00.000Z', '2026-10-26T11:00:00.000Z', '580a7543-d6f2-475c-a235-255657dba3f5'),
  ('20f897cf-c759-4b98-b588-fd0a75308a69', '0580e311-3b6f-4fd3-b86d-20ef652ac6ad', 'c630956c-5718-46db-8b26-3e5acb54fb39', '55b158f3-88f2-4ec3-a2c1-2a5dccd9adf5', 'Dear parents, a quick update: Ms. Pooja is on leave this week, so a few sessions are being covered by other therapists. Aarav’s sessions are not affected.', '[]', '2026-10-27T06:35:00.000Z', '2026-10-27T06:35:00.000Z', '55b158f3-88f2-4ec3-a2c1-2a5dccd9adf5'),
  ('af8a8513-2339-4f28-af2d-23ce83ca338d', '0580e311-3b6f-4fd3-b86d-20ef652ac6ad', 'c630956c-5718-46db-8b26-3e5acb54fb39', '2b060f38-ce0d-4ff2-84e3-28dbc9fba0d1', 'Noted, thank you. Also, can we move next week''s OT session? We have a family wedding in Agra. I''ve sent a request in the app.', '[]', '2026-10-28T14:44:00.000Z', '2026-10-28T14:44:00.000Z', '2b060f38-ce0d-4ff2-84e3-28dbc9fba0d1'),
  ('d3cb7af8-e3d0-4357-ba28-11da0b2c3e51', '0580e311-3b6f-4fd3-b86d-20ef652ac6ad', 'c630956c-5718-46db-8b26-3e5acb54fb39', '55b158f3-88f2-4ec3-a2c1-2a5dccd9adf5', 'Received, Priya ji. I''ll check Ms. Neha''s schedule and confirm by this evening.', '[]', '2026-10-29T03:35:00.000Z', '2026-10-29T03:35:00.000Z', '55b158f3-88f2-4ec3-a2c1-2a5dccd9adf5'),
  ('b3af2ecd-0e1f-42ac-adc7-8bf4e959c9c9', '0580e311-3b6f-4fd3-b86d-20ef652ac6ad', '87b3a93f-3b2e-4c20-8e3d-5e5e6be0fe6d', '68e54617-51f3-4b9b-ab2c-db49b3665be5', 'Aarav had two meltdowns on Saturday at clean-up time. The 2-minute timer helped the second time. Can we all use the same timer picture?', '[]', '2026-10-21T07:50:00.000Z', '2026-10-21T07:50:00.000Z', '68e54617-51f3-4b9b-ab2c-db49b3665be5'),
  ('9f499cc3-2e84-4b78-88ce-89c6625cb7dd', '0580e311-3b6f-4fd3-b86d-20ef652ac6ad', '87b3a93f-3b2e-4c20-8e3d-5e5e6be0fe6d', '8e94c13e-ee62-4ad4-8a50-2e27fce9bd4d', 'Yes — I will use the red sand-timer card from his schedule. His 2-word requests are picking up nicely in speech.', '[]', '2026-10-21T09:32:00.000Z', '2026-10-21T09:32:00.000Z', '8e94c13e-ee62-4ad4-8a50-2e27fce9bd4d'),
  ('0b314fc8-3f9e-471c-ba37-7e29116f741d', '0580e311-3b6f-4fd3-b86d-20ef652ac6ad', '87b3a93f-3b2e-4c20-8e3d-5e5e6be0fe6d', '580a7543-d6f2-475c-a235-255657dba3f5', 'Agreed. In OT he touched dough with a spoon for 2 minutes today — a big step for him.', '[]', '2026-10-22T06:18:00.000Z', '2026-10-22T06:18:00.000Z', '580a7543-d6f2-475c-a235-255657dba3f5'),
  ('915df93c-8a50-4524-96c5-ba81d97e1d11', '0580e311-3b6f-4fd3-b86d-20ef652ac6ad', '87b3a93f-3b2e-4c20-8e3d-5e5e6be0fe6d', '55b158f3-88f2-4ec3-a2c1-2a5dccd9adf5', 'Lovely progress, team. Riya, I''ve moved ''responds to name'' to Wins — please keep a probe every couple of weeks.', '[]', '2026-10-25T12:00:00.000Z', '2026-10-25T12:00:00.000Z', '55b158f3-88f2-4ec3-a2c1-2a5dccd9adf5'),
  ('3ed2ff78-c743-4898-a99c-9e7dc7227039', '0580e311-3b6f-4fd3-b86d-20ef652ac6ad', '87b3a93f-3b2e-4c20-8e3d-5e5e6be0fe6d', '8e94c13e-ee62-4ad4-8a50-2e27fce9bd4d', 'Will do. He settles faster when sessions start with the swing — added that to his Do’s.', '[]', '2026-10-27T12:20:00.000Z', '2026-10-27T12:20:00.000Z', '8e94c13e-ee62-4ad4-8a50-2e27fce9bd4d'),
  ('36dd6b1e-a622-49b0-933a-dbff39d8f63d', '0580e311-3b6f-4fd3-b86d-20ef652ac6ad', 'e50beb51-a107-401d-9f17-cb2dc2f8c535', '8e94c13e-ee62-4ad4-8a50-2e27fce9bd4d', 'Hi Priya ji, Anaya is getting the ''k'' sound in words like cat and cup almost every time now. If this continues we''ll mark the goal as achieved soon!', '[]', '2026-10-25T07:40:00.000Z', '2026-10-25T07:40:00.000Z', '8e94c13e-ee62-4ad4-8a50-2e27fce9bd4d'),
  ('bf50f7ca-6fc3-4ce0-851d-19db60f51dad', '0580e311-3b6f-4fd3-b86d-20ef652ac6ad', 'e50beb51-a107-401d-9f17-cb2dc2f8c535', '2b060f38-ce0d-4ff2-84e3-28dbc9fba0d1', 'That''s so good to hear! She has been playing the ticking-clock game with her brother.', '[]', '2026-10-25T08:32:00.000Z', '2026-10-25T08:32:00.000Z', '2b060f38-ce0d-4ff2-84e3-28dbc9fba0d1'),
  ('5a75396c-2976-4008-8d5b-46b9f736ab11', '0580e311-3b6f-4fd3-b86d-20ef652ac6ad', 'e50beb51-a107-401d-9f17-cb2dc2f8c535', '2b060f38-ce0d-4ff2-84e3-28dbc9fba0d1', 'Ma''am, Anaya has a mild cold. Is it okay to send her for the next session?', '[]', '2026-10-28T03:10:00.000Z', '2026-10-28T03:10:00.000Z', '2b060f38-ce0d-4ff2-84e3-28dbc9fba0d1'),
  ('2809f403-fa99-4a80-ac66-df9e1f310d39', '0580e311-3b6f-4fd3-b86d-20ef652ac6ad', 'e50beb51-a107-401d-9f17-cb2dc2f8c535', '8e94c13e-ee62-4ad4-8a50-2e27fce9bd4d', 'Yes, if there''s no fever she can come. We''ll keep the session lighter.', '[]', '2026-10-28T03:45:00.000Z', '2026-10-28T03:45:00.000Z', '8e94c13e-ee62-4ad4-8a50-2e27fce9bd4d'),
  ('837db7eb-ede8-4840-8808-4e1a560eb451', '0580e311-3b6f-4fd3-b86d-20ef652ac6ad', 'eafabb56-dfb7-4aa8-a53a-0907db1eac81', '8e94c13e-ee62-4ad4-8a50-2e27fce9bd4d', 'Meera, Anaya has met the mastery criterion for /k/ and /g/ (3 sessions at 80%+). I will confirm after the next probe.', '[]', '2026-10-26T11:35:00.000Z', '2026-10-26T11:35:00.000Z', '8e94c13e-ee62-4ad4-8a50-2e27fce9bd4d'),
  ('e381864d-5eb6-442c-8d1e-065c4c91de21', '0580e311-3b6f-4fd3-b86d-20ef652ac6ad', 'eafabb56-dfb7-4aa8-a53a-0907db1eac81', '55b158f3-88f2-4ec3-a2c1-2a5dccd9adf5', 'Great. Let''s add /k/ in the middle of words as the next goal.', '[]', '2026-10-26T12:50:00.000Z', '2026-10-26T12:50:00.000Z', '55b158f3-88f2-4ec3-a2c1-2a5dccd9adf5'),
  ('a7958fd4-4429-4380-ae32-2e81618701b1', '0580e311-3b6f-4fd3-b86d-20ef652ac6ad', 'dbed042c-64be-434c-ba74-040de35d7be1', '68e54617-51f3-4b9b-ab2c-db49b3665be5', 'Flagging Vihaan — his last 3 behaviour sessions were much harder: calling out, two refusals. Mother mentioned poor sleep since the baby arrived.', '[]', '2026-10-28T07:35:00.000Z', '2026-10-28T07:35:00.000Z', '68e54617-51f3-4b9b-ab2c-db49b3665be5'),
  ('9380f4f4-6207-4c70-b8db-71f964e9a5c5', '0580e311-3b6f-4fd3-b86d-20ef652ac6ad', 'dbed042c-64be-434c-ba74-040de35d7be1', '55b158f3-88f2-4ec3-a2c1-2a5dccd9adf5', 'Thanks Arjun, I''ve seen the alert. Let''s call the parents this week and check whether medicine timing has changed.', '[]', '2026-10-28T09:10:00.000Z', '2026-10-28T09:10:00.000Z', '55b158f3-88f2-4ec3-a2c1-2a5dccd9adf5'),
  ('0c634c36-cbac-4ecf-9b38-94c4613be0f1', '0580e311-3b6f-4fd3-b86d-20ef652ac6ad', 'dbed042c-64be-434c-ba74-040de35d7be1', '8e94c13e-ee62-4ad4-8a50-2e27fce9bd4d', 'Seeing the same in speech — shorter attention. I will keep tasks to 5 minutes.', '[]', '2026-10-29T03:20:00.000Z', '2026-10-29T03:20:00.000Z', '8e94c13e-ee62-4ad4-8a50-2e27fce9bd4d'),
  ('28a97690-707b-4b80-8cd1-d84192eef469', '0580e311-3b6f-4fd3-b86d-20ef652ac6ad', 'd5794d53-f536-4a95-9219-3c9ff81fa595', '55b158f3-88f2-4ec3-a2c1-2a5dccd9adf5', 'Dear Mr. and Mrs. Agarwal, could we have a short call this week about Vihaan’s sessions? Nothing to worry about — we would like to understand how his sleep has been.', '[]', '2026-10-28T09:40:00.000Z', '2026-10-28T09:40:00.000Z', '55b158f3-88f2-4ec3-a2c1-2a5dccd9adf5'),
  ('f2259828-15f4-4454-b1df-887912a53bd5', '0580e311-3b6f-4fd3-b86d-20ef652ac6ad', 'd5794d53-f536-4a95-9219-3c9ff81fa595', '2535fb0e-6441-42a0-aa1c-78af9c0d4549', 'Sure Ma''am, Thursday after 5 PM works for us.', '[]', '2026-10-28T13:55:00.000Z', '2026-10-28T13:55:00.000Z', '2535fb0e-6441-42a0-aa1c-78af9c0d4549'),
  ('13c73ba1-29fd-440c-9475-fba494390e69', '0580e311-3b6f-4fd3-b86d-20ef652ac6ad', '9dfdd38e-0329-49d0-bd4b-512ba91858e5', '55b158f3-88f2-4ec3-a2c1-2a5dccd9adf5', 'Riya, you''re covering Advik''s speech session today while Pooja is on leave (until 31 Oct 2026). Please read the brief first — keep his AAC device within reach and offer the break card early.', '[]', '2026-10-28T06:00:00.000Z', '2026-10-28T06:00:00.000Z', '55b158f3-88f2-4ec3-a2c1-2a5dccd9adf5'),
  ('1faca2c4-0d7a-4ad8-8266-c81d1648db29', '0580e311-3b6f-4fd3-b86d-20ef652ac6ad', '9dfdd38e-0329-49d0-bd4b-512ba91858e5', '934479b0-7350-4029-9b97-4588c53d36d1', 'Thanks Riya! The plan is on the brief: ''more'' and ''stop'' on the AAC core page during bubbles. Whining or flapping means he needs the break card.', '[]', '2026-10-28T06:40:00.000Z', '2026-10-28T06:40:00.000Z', '934479b0-7350-4029-9b97-4588c53d36d1'),
  ('8cb40a20-71ac-42bc-8337-6cb99aa5d18d', '0580e311-3b6f-4fd3-b86d-20ef652ac6ad', '9dfdd38e-0329-49d0-bd4b-512ba91858e5', '8e94c13e-ee62-4ad4-8a50-2e27fce9bd4d', 'Got it, I will read it before the session.', '[]', '2026-10-28T06:55:00.000Z', '2026-10-28T06:55:00.000Z', '8e94c13e-ee62-4ad4-8a50-2e27fce9bd4d'),
  ('c5562413-d699-47f8-bf21-ba2260c080a9', '4af0f750-d9c2-4240-8024-206161c10975', '75614ee6-aebf-488b-b325-dff0d1ef0859', '816f51c9-7848-416e-8c30-f222690571cd', 'Hello Lakshmi ma’am, Adi is saying "neeru beku" (want water) at home now! Should we keep mixing Kannada and English?', '[]', '2026-10-26T12:40:00.000Z', '2026-10-26T12:40:00.000Z', '816f51c9-7848-416e-8c30-f222690571cd'),
  ('726ee73b-cb58-46e4-a609-acaea84677a5', '4af0f750-d9c2-4240-8024-206161c10975', '75614ee6-aebf-488b-b325-dff0d1ef0859', 'c92376df-53dc-440e-8268-fcf0c8dc2011', 'Lovely! Yes, please use whichever words come naturally at home. Two languages will not confuse him.', '[]', '2026-10-27T04:50:00.000Z', '2026-10-27T04:50:00.000Z', 'c92376df-53dc-440e-8268-fcf0c8dc2011'),
  ('33812ecf-f24d-4f24-b818-920643af9219', '4af0f750-d9c2-4240-8024-206161c10975', 'dd4092ab-6209-4154-a0de-ca0651b262d1', '8a7186b0-66cb-4898-8ca7-b5d5a4b67f3d', 'Rahul had 3 incidents today — mostly when water play ended. I will try a visual timer and a trade token next session.', '[]', '2026-10-28T07:10:00.000Z', '2026-10-28T07:10:00.000Z', '8a7186b0-66cb-4898-8ca7-b5d5a4b67f3d'),
  ('3c6629e0-f6b1-4d5c-97d3-205dc180bf19', '4af0f750-d9c2-4240-8024-206161c10975', 'dd4092ab-6209-4154-a0de-ca0651b262d1', '067be50a-76ed-4d22-896c-052187643dc9', 'Thanks Rohan. Please share the plan with Deepa too so OT ends the same way.', '[]', '2026-10-28T10:35:00.000Z', '2026-10-28T10:35:00.000Z', '067be50a-76ed-4d22-896c-052187643dc9')
